// CAIStateGroup_MinionReactToUnconsciousPerson::FindUnconsciousPerson() -- once a second (staggered by the creature's
// UID), find the nearest unconscious ally the creature is aware of within a 7-unit rough box.
// Retail: Fable.exe (TLC, VC7.1) function @ 0x00937C20, length 253 bytes (+ int3 padding).
// Callees: GFGetCurrentFrame @ 0x0049D870, __allrem @ 0x00BFEC30 (signed 64-bit `(frame + UID) % fps`), CThing::
// GetPosition @ 0x004C73D0 (x2), __ftol2 @ 0x00BFEA70 (x2), CAIStateGroupBase::PeekThingSearchTools @ 0x008FD000,
// CThingSearchTools::GetPBestThingInRoughArea<CFilter_Bind3<CThingFilter_IsAICreatureAwareOf, CThingFilter_IsUnconscious,
// CThingFilter_IsAnAlly>, CThingCompare_Nearest, CThingCreatureBase> @ 0x00937690. Global: the frame-rate long
// @ 0x01375550 (read first).
// Shape: the landed filter-chain model (`a && b && c` binding pointers to frame temporaries; the empty filter is one
// byte); the result is zeroed up front and returned through its out slot.
// ---- shared AI state-group model (same shapes as the landed CAIStateGroup_* sources) ----
struct CTCBase;
struct CWorld;

